@* The user guide for the web app, linked from the bottom of Settings. Plain text; keep it in step with the pages. *@

<PageTitle>User guide · Kolibri Kino</PageTitle>

<article class="guide">
    <h1>User guide</h1>
    <p class="hint">Kolibri Kino on the web: your movie and series library (SilverScreen.db), what's on TMDb, your lists and your
        ratings, from any browser at home, phones too.</p>

    <nav class="guide-toc" aria-label="Contents">
        <a href="guide#menu">The menu</a>
        <a href="guide#library">Library</a>
        <a href="guide#details">A movie or series</a>
        <a href="guide#play">Play</a>
        <a href="guide#recent">Recently added</a>
        <a href="guide#trending">Trending</a>
        <a href="guide#discover">Discover</a>
        <a href="guide#watchlists">Watchlists</a>
        <a href="guide#wishlist">Wishlist</a>
        <a href="guide#ratings">My rating</a>
